          <bpmn:documentation>workflows/learn/skills/curation/SKILL.md, step 6, through workflows/learn/tools/record-status.mjs. Every goal this phase was invited for gets exactly one line: `curated` for one that now has live entries — including a goal only stamped in step 0 — and `blocked … needs: goal-setting` for one nothing could be built for, with what would have to change. There is no third outcome. A goal left on the queue is a goal learn invites this phase back for, silently, forever, with nobody present to fix what is actually wrong with it; that dead end is what the status log was built to close.</bpmn:documentation>
